<!-- The D.P.R. complaint's Word styles: the cross-engine recipe (tools/fb/src/docxxengine.rs) in the face of the typst
     template ({font}, Times New Roman) at 12 pt (size 24 half points, PRD-FORM-002, L.Civ.R. 7); Body Text in exact
     24 pt line boxes (typst pitch-double, PRD-FORM-003 double spacing) with a half-inch indent, and the headings in
     them; the caption, signature and footer lines in 13.8 pt boxes (typst pitch-single); letter page with 1-inch
     margins (PRD-FORM-004). The footer (rIdFtrDash) is the typst one (PRD-FORM-005): "-N-" centered at 12 pt in a
     13.8 pt line box, the line 36.6 pt above the page foot (732 twips: where typst sets it, footer-descent 30 %).
     docx/prd-complaint.lua writes every paragraph's own spacing. Twips: 20 x pt. -->
<reference xmlns:w="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main" xmlns:r="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/relationships" base="xengine" size="24" body="480" single="276" indent="720" heading="480" heading-before="0" heading-after="0" footer="732">
